<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="평범한(?) 교육사 공식 커뮤니티">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#536dfe">

<title>평범한(?) 교육사 공식 커뮤니티</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family:
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        "Noto Sans KR",
        sans-serif;
    background: #080d18;
    color: #f1f4ff;
}

button,
input,
textarea,
select {
    font: inherit;
}

button {
    cursor: pointer;
}

header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(10, 16, 30, 0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #293654;
}

.header-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 15px;
}

.top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 900;
}

.logo small {
    display: block;
    color: #8997b5;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 3px;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-top: 13px;
}

nav button {
    border: 1px solid #31405f;
    background: #151f35;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

nav button.active {
    background: #536dfe;
    border-color: #536dfe;
}

main {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 20px 15px 40px;
}

.hero {
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, #172448, #10182b);
    border: 1px solid #2b3b5e;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}

.hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 6vw, 38px);
}

.hero p {
    color: #b7c2dc;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn {
    border: 1px solid #334263;
    background: #151f35;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 11px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
}

.btn.primary {
    background: #536dfe;
    border-color: #536dfe;
}

.layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(230px, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
}

.card {
    background: #10192b;
    border: 1px solid #293754;
    border-radius: 17px;
    padding: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 13px;
}

.post {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color .15s;
}

.post:hover {
    border-color: #596fff;
}

.tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: #202c4b;
    color: #aebaff;
    font-size: 11px;
}

.title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 850;
    margin: 9px 0 6px;
}

.meta {
    color: #8997b7;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.body {
    color: #c1c9dc;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.video {
    margin-top: 13px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: #05080f;
}

.video iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
}

.stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 7px;
}

.stat {
    background: #0c1424;
    border: 1px solid #263451;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 11px 5px;
}

.stat b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 19px;
}

.stat span {
    color: #8794b1;
    font-size: 11px;
}

.heart {
    border: 1px solid #49304a;
    background: #211727;
    color: #ff8bbd;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 13px;
    margin-top: 12px;
}

input,
textarea,
select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 11px;
    margin: 6px 0 13px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #30405f;
    background: #0b1322;
    color: white;
    outline: none;
}

textarea {
    min-height: 140px;
    resize: vertical;
}

label {
    color: #aeb9d0;
    font-size: 12px;
}

.comment {
    border-top: 1px solid #27334d;
    padding: 12px 0;
}

.comment-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.empty {
    text-align: center;
    color: #8290ac;
    padding: 45px 15px;
}

.notice {
    color: #93a0bc;
    background: #0c1424;
    border: 1px solid #263451;
    padding: 11px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    font-size: 12px;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    color: #66738f;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 25px;
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {

    .layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .side {
        display: none;
    }

    .hero {
        padding: 23px;
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 18px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<div class="header-inner">

<div class="top">

<div class="logo">
🪖 평범한(?) 교육사 공식
<small>Official Roblox Creator Community</small>
</div>

<button class="btn primary" onclick="writePost()">
✏️ 글쓰기
</button>

</div>

<nav id="navigation"></nav>

</div>

</header>


<main>

<section class="hero">

<h1>평범한(?) 교육사 공식 커뮤니티</h1>

<p>
Roblox 이야기부터 영상, 교육사 이야기까지
함께 이야기하는 공식 커뮤니티입니다.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<button class="btn primary" onclick="writePost()">
✏️ 게시글 작성
</button>

<button class="btn" onclick="changeCategory('영상')">
🎬 영상 보기
</button>

</div>

</section>


<div class="layout">

<section id="content"></section>


<aside class="side">

<div class="card">

<h3>📊 커뮤니티</h3>

<div class="stats">

<div class="stat">
<b id="posts">0</b>
<span>게시글</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<b id="comments">0</b>
<span>댓글</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<b id="videos">0</b>
<span>영상</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>🔥 인기 태그</h3>

<span class="tag">#Roblox</span>
<span class="tag">#교육사</span>
<span class="tag">#영상</span>
<span class="tag">#동굴부대</span>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>📌 공식 커뮤니티</h3>

<p class="meta">
평범한(?) 교육사의 공식 커뮤니티입니다.
</p>

</div>

</aside>

</div>

</main>


<footer>
© 2026 평범한(?) 교육사 · Official Community
</footer>


<script>

const defaultPosts = [

{
id: 1,
category: "공지",
title: "🎉 평범한(?) 교육사 공식 커뮤니티 오픈!",
body: "평범한(?) 교육사 공식 커뮤니티에 오신 것을 환영합니다!",
author: "관리자",
date: "2026.09.27",
likes: 12,
youtube: ""
},

{
id: 2,
category: "영상",
title: "🎬 군사경찰 몰래 치킨 먹기",
body: "교육사에서 벌어진 재미있는 Roblox 영상을 만나보세요!",
author: "평범한(?) 교육사",
date: "2026.09.27",
likes: 8,
youtube: ""
},

{
id: 3,
category: "Roblox",
title: "🪖 동굴부대 근황",
body: "Roblox 동굴부대에서 발견한 재미있는 장면을 공유합니다.",
author: "상등병",
date: "2026.09.26",
likes: 5,
youtube: ""
}

];


let posts =
JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("official_posts"))
|| defaultPosts;


let comments =
JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("official_comments"))
|| [];


let currentCategory = "전체";


function save() {

localStorage.setItem(
"official_posts",
JSON.stringify(posts)
);

localStorage.setItem(
"official_comments",
JSON.stringify(comments)
);

updateStats();

}


function escapeHTML(text) {

return String(text)
.replaceAll("&","&amp;")
.replaceAll("<","&lt;")
.replaceAll(">","&gt;")
.replaceAll('"',"&quot;")
.replaceAll("'","&#039;");

}


function getYoutubeId(url) {

if (!url) return "";

try {

const parsed = new URL(url);

if (
parsed.hostname.includes("youtube.com")
) {

return parsed.searchParams.get("v") || "";

}

if (
parsed.hostname.includes("youtu.be")
) {

return parsed.pathname.substring(1);

}

} catch {}

return "";

}


function youtube(url) {

const id = getYoutubeId(url);

if (!id) return "";

return `

<div class="video">

<iframe
src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/${encodeURIComponent(id)}"
title="YouTube video"
allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
allowfullscreen>
</iframe>

</div>

`;

}


function updateStats() {

document.getElementById("posts").textContent =
posts.length;

document.getElementById("comments").textContent =
comments.length;

document.getElementById("videos").textContent =
posts.filter(p => p.category === "영상" || p.youtube).length;

}


function createNavigation() {

const nav =
document.getElementById("navigation");

nav.innerHTML = "";

[
"전체",
"공지",
"자유",
"Roblox",
"영상"
].forEach(category => {

const button =
document.createElement("button");

button.textContent = category;

if (category === currentCategory) {
button.classList.add("active");
}

button.onclick = () =>
changeCategory(category);

nav.appendChild(button);

});

}


function changeCategory(category) {

currentCategory = category;

render();

}


function render() {

createNavigation();

const filtered =
currentCategory === "전체"
? posts
: posts.filter(
post => post.category === currentCategory
);

const content =
document.getElementById("content");


if (!filtered.length) {

content.innerHTML =
`
<div class="card empty">
아직 게시글이 없습니다.
</div>
`;

updateStats();

return;

}


content.innerHTML =
filtered.map(post => `

<article
class="card post"
onclick="openPost(${post.id})"
>

<span class="tag">
#${escapeHTML(post.category)}
</span>

<div class="title">
${escapeHTML(post.title)}
</div>

<div class="meta">
${escapeHTML(post.author)}
·
${escapeHTML(post.date)}
</div>

<div class="body">
${escapeHTML(post.body)}
</div>

${youtube(post.youtube)}

<div>

<button
class="heart"
onclick="event.stopPropagation(); like(${post.id})"
>
❤️ ${post.likes}
</button>

</div>

</article>

`).join("");

updateStats();

}


function like(id) {

const post =
posts.find(p => p.id === id);

if (!post) return;

post.likes++;

save();

render();

}


function openPost(id) {

const post =
posts.find(p => p.id === id);

if (!post) return;

const postComments =
comments.filter(
comment => comment.postId === id
);


document.getElementById("content").innerHTML = `

<div class="card">

<button
class="btn"
onclick="render()"
>
← 목록으로
</button>

<br><br>

<span class="tag">
#${escapeHTML(post.category)}
</span>

<h2>
${escapeHTML(post.title)}
</h2>

<div class="meta">
${escapeHTML(post.author)}
·
${escapeHTML(post.date)}
</div>

<div class="body">
${escapeHTML(post.body)
.replaceAll("\n","<br>")}
</div>

${youtube(post.youtube)}

<br>

<button
class="heart"
onclick="likeDetail(${post.id})"
>
❤️ ${post.likes}
</button>

<hr style="
border:0;
border-top:1px solid #27334d;
margin:22px 0;
">

<h3>
💬 댓글
</h3>

${
postComments.length
?
postComments.map(comment => `

<div class="comment">

<div class="comment-name">
${escapeHTML(comment.author)}
</div>

<div>
${escapeHTML(comment.text)}
</div>

</div>

`).join("")
:
`<div class="meta">
아직 댓글이 없습니다.
</div>`
}

<br>

<input
id="commentInput"
placeholder="댓글을 입력하세요"
>

<button
class="btn primary"
onclick="addComment(${post.id})"
>
댓글 등록
</button>

</div>

`;

}


function likeDetail(id) {

const post =
posts.find(p => p.id === id);

if (!post) return;

post.likes++;

save();

openPost(id);

}


function addComment(id) {

const input =
document.getElementById("commentInput");

const text =
input.value.trim();

if (!text) {

alert("댓글을 입력해주세요.");

return;

}


comments.push({

postId: id,

author: "방문자",

text: text

});

save();

openPost(id);

}


function writePost() {

document.getElementById("content").innerHTML = `

<div class="card">

<h2>
✏️ 게시글 작성
</h2>

<label>
게시판
</label>

<select id="newCategory">

<option>자유</option>
<option>Roblox</option>
<option>영상</option>

</select>


<label>
제목
</label>

<input
id="newTitle"
maxlength="100"
placeholder="제목을 입력하세요"
>


<label>
내용
</label>

<textarea
id="newBody"
placeholder="내용을 입력하세요"
></textarea>


<label>
YouTube 주소
</label>

<input
id="newYoutube"
placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..."
>


<div class="notice">

YouTube 주소를 입력하면
게시글에서 영상을 바로 볼 수 있습니다.

</div>

<br>

<button
class="btn"
onclick="render()"
>
취소
</button>

<button
class="btn primary"
onclick="submitPost()"
>
게시하기
</button>

</div>

`;

}


function submitPost() {

const category =
document.getElementById("newCategory").value;

const title =
document.getElementById("newTitle").value.trim();

const body =
document.getElementById("newBody").value.trim();

const youtubeUrl =
document.getElementById("newYoutube").value.trim();


if (!title || !body) {

alert("제목과 내용을 입력해주세요.");

return;

}


posts.unshift({

id: Date.now(),

category: category,

title: title,

body: body,

author: "방문자",

date: new Date()
.toLocaleDateString("ko-KR"),

likes: 0,

youtube: youtubeUrl

});


save();

currentCategory = "전체";

render();

}


render();

</script>

</body>
</html>
